{
  "name": "truth",
  "note": "The MC-truth graph as the TruthInfo NanoAOD tables write it (CMSSW branch mmarriot:truthgraph-nano-tables; phase2.json includes this): TruthParticles (the signal, the particles reco objects are matched to, every particle that entered the calorimeter, and their ancestors), TruthVertices, their parent -> child links; the simulated energy of each particle in each HGCal and PF rechit (the hit index's Calo channel; PF rechits found by DetId in the tables split by subdetector); the reco <-> truth associations of the truth-graph associators (TruthBranch*: tracks, TICL tracksters and candidate tracksters, ECAL and HCAL PF clusters) in both directions. Particles are drawn as helices from their production vertex (TruthVertices[prodVertexIdx]) with the momentum of pt, eta, phi, to their decay vertex; in-time pile-up only (bunch crossing 0) and the vertices they reach. Primary and secondary vertices matched to truth vertices (pT^2 share of their tracks; the truth vertices they match are kept). Truth is only the truth graph, its hit index and its associators.",
